        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bugsy Siegel, Mickey Cohen, David Berman, Harold \"Hooky\" Rothman, Moe Sedway, Jack Dragna, Gus Greenbaum\n- Places: Los Angeles, Las Vegas\n- Organizations: Cohen crime family, L.A. family\n- Products: Flamingo Hotel & Casino\n- Topics: illegal gambling, prostitution\n\nFacts:\n- Bugsy Siegel ran illegal gambling and prostitution rings in Los Angeles and later Las Vegas with his lieutenants Mickey Cohen, David Berman, Harold \"Hooky\" Rothman, Moe Sedway, and Jack Dragna of the L.A. family.\n- After Bugsy Siegel's murder, Moe Sedway and Gus Greenbaum made the Flamingo Hotel & Casino in Las Vegas very successful.",
